# IMX round 4: send ducking. Synth 1 plays C4 on three steps, the send ducking follows Synth 1 (source 11) at 80 % depth (a sample voice is silent in the sim: the wav of a sample instrument set up by the poke stays 0, so the source is a synth part). The trace carries the lowest duck gain the engine reached (dgmin, 1000 = never ducked) and the parameters
# Replay: plus_flows.sh plus  (setup pokes in plus_flows.sh, the poke trace UISHOT_TRACE_FFSTATE is the read, poke_ok in plus_flows.sh)
title: send ducking (Tracker+, IMX round 4)
check: texts
pause: 80ms

use boot-to-pattern
wait 3000ms
tap Play
wait 7000ms
shot duck-playing
tap Play
wait 1500ms
shot duck-stopped
